OL,3,GNEWSA'We gave our spare room to a young
OL,4,Ahomeless woman'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAva ended up living in hostels when a
OL,7,Frelationship breakdown left her
OL,8,Fhomeless.
OL,10,FThe 22-year-old felt "lost in the
OL,11,Fsystem", but has now found safety,
OL,12,Fsecurity and friendship after moving in
OL,13,Fwith a host family.
OL,15,FMike and Beth Edwards gave a spare
OL,16,Fbedroom in their house in York to Ava
OL,17,Fafter she was referred to them by youth
OL,18,Fhomelessness charity SASH (Safe and
OL,19,FSound Homes).
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
