OL,3,GNEWSA'We gave our spare room to a young
OL,4,Ahomeless woman'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe couple, who are in their 30s and
OL,7,Flive with their dog Lilah, have been
OL,8,Fpart of the hosting scheme for four
OL,9,Fyears, and Ava is their fifth guest at
OL,10,Ftheir three-bedroom house.
